    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You have optimized your ambush technique to the point of lethal perfection.</p><p>Tactical Cloak's precision damage starts from <strong>3d6</strong> instead of 2d6, before level multiplies it: 12d6 at 12th level, 15d6 at 16th and 18d6 at 20th. Additionally, if your cloaked Strike reduces a target to 0 HP, your Tactical Cloak immediately reactivates at no action cost, whatever its cooldown (once per minute).</p><p><em>Prerequisite: Ghost Protocol. Classes: Infiltrator.</em></p><hr/><p><em>Automation: the extra dice are added to Strikes while the Tactical Cloak effect is on you. To bring the cloak back after a kill, send this feat to chat: the effect goes back on. The once-a-minute limit is yours to track.</em></p>"
